\">Entity ID</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><code>821.0</code></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"environment\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Found In</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\"><img alt=\"Stage Mines icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mines icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mines_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Stage_Mines_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172320\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ashpit\" title=\"Ashpit\"><img alt=\"Stage Ashpit icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Ashpit icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Ashpit_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/c/cf/Stage_Ashpit_icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210825172340\" /></a></span><br /><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Challenge_Room\" title=\"Challenge Room\"><img alt=\"Challenge Room Icon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"27\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Challenge Room Icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Challenge_Room_Icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/1b/Challenge_Room_Icon.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821102142\" /></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><div id=\"context-page\" class=\"context-box\"><span class=\"mw-default-size dlc dlc-8\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Added in Repentance\"><img alt=\"(in Repentance)\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dlc r indicator.png\" data-image-key=\"Dlc_r_indicator.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/f/f2/Dlc_r_indicator.png/revision/latest?cb=20210815090252\" /></span></span> </div>\n<p>The <b>Blaster</b> is an enemy that is exclusive to <span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\"><img alt=\"Mines\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stage Mines icon.png\" data-image-key=\"Stage_Mines_icon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/5/58/Stage_Mines_icon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210825172320\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Mines\" title=\"Mines\">Mines</a>. It is characterized by a large boulder with holes on its upper body and its lack of arms. \n</p><p>It slowly wanders around and occasionally shoots a &#32;<span class=\"inline-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_Bomb\" title=\"Fly Bomb\"><img alt=\"Fly Bomb\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Fly Bomb.png\" data-image-key=\"Fly_Bomb.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/3/3c/Fly_Bomb.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20210407204949\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fly_Bomb\" title=\"Fly Bomb\">Fly Bomb</a> at Isaac. When it shoots, the boulder on its head forms an opening for the Fly Bomb to be shot out of.\n</p><p>Blasters take only 25% damage from non-explosive sources. Their own Fly Bombs can be used against them to quickly defeat them.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a href=\"https://antibirth.fandom.com/wiki/Blaster\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"anti:Blaster\">Blaster</a> first appeared in the <i>Antibirth</i> mod.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6b/Blaster_Ashpit.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824145611\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"A Blaster&#39;s appearance in Ashpit.\"><img alt=\"A Blaster&#39;s appearance in Ashpit.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"102\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blaster Ashpit.png\" data-image-key=\"Blaster_Ashpit.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/6/6b/Blaster_Ashpit.png/revision/latest?cb=20210824145611\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\"> A Blaster's appearance in Ashpit.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px; height: 150px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/17/Mini_wrath_concept.png/revision/latest?cb=20230111014452\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Concept art for the Blaster.\"><img alt=\"Concept art for the Blaster.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"79\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Mini wrath concept.png\" data-image-key=\"Mini_wrath_concept.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/1/17/Mini_wrath_concept.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/120?cb=20230111014452\" /></a></span></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">Concept art for the Blaster.</div>\n\t\t</li>\n</ul>\n<p><br class=\"content-filter-end\" /></p><div class=\"nav-start\" style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n<table class=\"nav-box nav-main\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th class=\"nav-title\"><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Binding_of_Isaac:_Rebirth_Wiki\" title=\"Binding of Isaac: Rebirth Wiki\">The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth</a><span class=\"no-alt\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"SmallIsaac\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-image-key=\"SmallIsaac.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/bindingofisaacre_gamepedia/images/a/a6/SmallIsaac.png/revision/latest?cb=20210821194340\" /></span></span>\n</th></tr>